0 x - 4 y^{2})\\,i+(- 8 x y + 8 y)\\,j \\\\ ∇f(-2,3) & =(- 10 (-2) - 4 (3)^{2})\\,i+(- 8 (-2) (3) + 8 (3))\\,j \\\\  & =(-16)\\,i+(72)\\,j \\\\  & =⟨-16,72⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the Cartesian equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(-2,3)\\cdot ⟨x-(-2),\\,y-(3)⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨-16,72⟩\\cdot ⟨x + 2,\\,y - 3⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521734 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5ae7e9c8-60e9-5f5e-afbf-1de6bb01bf07" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Tangent Line to a Level Curve"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5d22a663-48a2-55aa-87ea-92afafe41064" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨- \\frac{3}{2},3⟩\\cdot ⟨x + \\frac{1}{2},\\,y - \\frac{1}{2}⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521699} {:answer/id #uuid "67e3d0eb-1a49-5657-bd18-9920d2fdd192" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨3,- \\frac{3}{2}⟩\\cdot ⟨x + \\frac{1}{2},\\,y - \\frac{1}{2}⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521703} {:answer/id #uuid "7e070eab-5072-5578-8ddd-95b7ea361e77" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨- \\frac{3}{2},3⟩\\cdot ⟨x + \\frac{1}{2},\\,y + \\frac{1}{2}⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521711} {:answer/id #uuid "84fdbbbf-e7b5-59c4-baca-28b3b77d3ea8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨- \\frac{3}{2},3⟩\\cdot ⟨x - \\frac{1}{2},\\,y - \\frac{1}{2}⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521714} {:answer/id #uuid "e5326f5b-b542-524b-ac5a-a375a939b9ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨\\frac{3}{2},3⟩\\cdot ⟨x + \\frac{1}{2},\\,y - \\frac{1}{2}⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521740}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5d22a663-48a2-55aa-87ea-92afafe41064" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨- \\frac{3}{2},3⟩\\cdot ⟨x + \\frac{1}{2},\\,y - \