}{∂x}(3 x^{2} + 6 x y^{2} + 6 y^{2})\\,i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3 x^{2} + 6 x y^{2} + 6 y^{2})\\,j \\\\  & =(6 x + 6 y^{2})\\,i+(12 x y + 12 y)\\,j \\\\ ∇f(3,1) & =(6 (3) + 6 (1)^{2})\\,i+(12 (3) (1) + 12 (1))\\,j \\\\  & =(24)\\,i+(48)\\,j \\\\  & =⟨24,48⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the Cartesian equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(3,1)\\cdot ⟨x-(3),\\,y-(1)⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨24,48⟩\\cdot ⟨x - 3,\\,y - 1⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186521743 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5ae7e9c8-60e9-5f5e-afbf-1de6bb01bf07" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Tangent Line to a Level Curve"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "00042721-b3b3-5fbd-b6e7-5fc25785342e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨15,102⟩\\cdot ⟨x - 3,\\,y - 3⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521675} {:answer/id #uuid "32a582f3-ec49-5904-99aa-53c73288aae3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨-15,102⟩\\cdot ⟨x - 3,\\,y - 3⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521690} {:answer/id #uuid "4b48aec1-60e5-583c-ada6-a775d24ebc37" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨15,102⟩\\cdot ⟨x - 3,\\,y + 3⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521692} {:answer/id #uuid "6fd2df2a-bf80-53d8-92cf-7e86fd6efaab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨15,102⟩\\cdot ⟨x + 3,\\,y - 3⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521705} {:answer/id #uuid "90b092f8-0fdd-5bdc-a2ce-b5869f85c49f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨102,15⟩\\cdot ⟨x - 3,\\,y - 3⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521720}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "00042721-b3b3-5fbd-b6e7-5fc25785342e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "⟨15,102⟩\\cdot ⟨x - 3,\\,y - 3⟩=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186521675} :answer-field/id #uuid "e75251e7-9449-527e-a205-be70